share was negatively impacted by elevated provisions for legal matters of $1.16 per diluted common share <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">(after-tax).</FONT> <SUP STYLE="font-size:75%; vertical-align:top">(13)</SUP> </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
