(negatively impacted by elevated legal provisions of 3.2%). <SUP STYLE="font-size:75%; vertical-align:top">(13)</SUP> </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
