<Center><DIV STYLE="width:8.5in" align="left">
 <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt" ALIGN="center">


<IMG SRC="g28114g00z04.jpg" ALT="LOGO">
 </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:14pt; font-family:Calibri" ALIGN="center"><FONT COLOR="#1f487c"><B><I>Institutional Group </I></B></FONT></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt; font-family:Calibri" ALIGN="center"><FONT COLOR="#1f487c"><B><I>Fourth Quarter Results
</I></B></FONT></P><DIV STYLE="line-height:3.0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:2pt;border-bottom:1.50pt solid #5b9bd5">&nbsp;</DIV> <P STYLE="margin-top:10pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:9pt; font-family:Calibri">Institutional Group reported net
revenues of $609.7&nbsp;million for the three months ended December&nbsp;31, 2025, compared with $478.3&nbsp;million during the fourth quarter of 2024. <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">Pre-tax</FONT> net income was $151.7&nbsp;million compared with
$95.7&nbsp;million in the fourth quarter of 2024. </P>
<P STYLE="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P><DIV STYLE="position:relative;float:left; width:48%;padding-right:0%;padding-bottom:8pt;overflow:visible;padding-top:3pt">
 <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Calibri" ALIGN="center"><FONT COLOR="#003057"><B><I><U>Highlights </U></I></B></FONT></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Calibri"><FONT COLOR="#003057"><B><I>Investment banking revenues increased 50% from a year ago: </I></B></FONT></P>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Calibri; font-size:9pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
<TR style = "page-break-inside:avoid">
<TD WIDTH="30" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left">


<IMG SRC="g28114dsp06a.jpg" ALT="LOGO">
</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:9pt; font-family:Calibri; " ALIGN="left">Advisory revenues increased 46% over the <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">year-ago</FONT> quarter, driven by higher
levels of completed advisory transactions. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Calibri; font-size:9pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
<TR style = "page-break-inside:avoid">
