<IMG SRC="g28114dsp06a.jpg" ALT="LOGO">
</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:9pt; font-family:Calibri; " ALIGN="left">Equity capital raising revenues increased 99% over the <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">year-ago</FONT> quarter, driven
by higher volumes and larger deal sizes. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Calibri; font-size:9pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
