</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:9pt; font-family:Calibri; " ALIGN="left">Fixed income capital raising revenues increased 23% over the <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">year-ago</FONT> quarter
primarily driven by higher bond issuances reflecting a more favorable financing environment and larger deal sizes. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Calibri"><FONT COLOR="#003057"><B><I>Fixed income transactional revenues decreased 18% from a year ago: </I></B></FONT></P>
