driven by an increase in equities trading commissions. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Calibri"><FONT COLOR="#003057"><B><I>Total Expenses: </I></B></FONT></P>
