STYLE="white-space:nowrap">three-for-two</FONT></FONT> stock split, effective February&nbsp;26, 2026, to shareholders of record at the close of business on February&nbsp;12, 2026. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
