<IMG SRC="g28114dsp06a.jpg" ALT="LOGO">
</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:9pt; font-family:Calibri; " ALIGN="left">The Company repurchased $39.0&nbsp;million of its outstanding common stock during the fourth quarter. During 2025, the
Company repurchased $370.6&nbsp;million of its outstanding common stock, including $126.0&nbsp;million in connection with <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">net-share</FONT> settlements under its equity compensation plan. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Calibri; font-size:9pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
